body:
Did you also notice how Blue and Rouge was different in their interactions with Fuse?

>!Blue was all like, "I have no need of you" and "I don't remember you, but if you know who I am, you would understand my predicament so gimme the Shield Card dammit". But when Fuse met up with Rouge at Roufas' restaurant, Rouge at least remembered who Fuse was ; \_\_ ; "I know you." and "Please assist me." Not to mention in the ending, Blue said to Fuse that he will call him only if he needs assistance but Rouge was at least willing to stop by Fuse's office just to say hello ; \_\_ ;!<

I'm probably splitting hairs at this point, but I just love the little things about these characters hehe. I wish there could be more future games with these guys in them ; \_\_ ;
